  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In 2024, the Federal Acquisition Service promoted FAST24 virtual training events covering topics such as evolving marketplaces and AI as a Service. In 2023, it described learning how emerging AI and cybersecurity technologies could affect teams and how GSA vehicles could help organizations improve resiliency and deploy solutions. It also listed AI, telecom, and cybersecurity as technologies impacting IT solutions and promoted modernizing technology workspaces with GSA.",
